1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,255
Continuity is conservation of mass.

2
00:00:03,255 --> 00:00:06,653
Bernoulli's equation is conservation of energy.

3
00:00:06,653 --> 00:00:19,791
For the steady, streamline flow of an ideal fluid, pressure, plus kinetic energy per unit volume, plus potential energy per unit volume, stays constant along a streamline.

